# The catalogue (S4.2a). Set apiKey to the key the Ingest's add-user printed, e.g. in http-client.env.json (git-ignored by
# you, not by the repo: don't commit a key).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = sp_paste-your-key-here

### First page of the catalogue (50 records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Next page: pass the previous page's nextAfter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences?after=50&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Filters: coronaviruses of 25-35 kbp whose name mentions SARS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences?kind=virus&rank=family&taxon=Coronaviridae&minLength=25000&maxLength=35000&name=SARS
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### One record: lineages, annotations, stored levels, provenance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences/1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Its 2 kbp level as ZCWP bytes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences/1/profile?windowSize=2000
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Error: a rank without a taxon (400, ProblemDetails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences?rank=family
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Error: a record that doesn't exist, or someone else's upload (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences/999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Error: no key (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences

### Upload FASTA (S4.2b): your own private records, profile only. The body is the file; metadata goes in the query string.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences?kind=virus&taxid=2697049&name=my%20isolate
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

< ./my-isolate.fna

### Upload a profile instead: the 500 bp level as ZCWP (the Ingest's profile command writes one), with the sequence's length
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences?kind=virus&lengthBp=29903&recordId=my-isolate
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/x-zcwp

< ./my-isolate.zcwp

### Error: no kind (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

>a
ACGT

### The 10 genomes nearest to a record by dinucleotide signature
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences/1/relatives?k=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Its signature as Z-curve coefficients (view=karlin gives the same vector per dinucleotide)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sequences/1/signature?view=zcurve
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### A tree of the genomes of one family, from their signatures
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trees?rank=family&taxon=Enterobacteriaceae&method=upgma
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### A tree of chosen records (3-500, all bacteria and archaea or all viruses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trees?ids=1,2,3,4&method=nj
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
